message: "If you use this software or its outputs, please cite it as below."
title: "Provenance screening for routine health-programme data: an instrument and two applications to WHO tuberculosis datasets"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible screens that distinguish, from the published file alone, which
  variables in a country-reported health dataset carry annual measurements and
  which carry carried-forward estimates or categorical status flags. Applied to
  443 numeric variables across six WHO Global Tuberculosis Programme datasets,
  and to India's national TB financing accounts. Includes the full verification
  suite and the archived input files.
type: software
